{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307220","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130722001:1":{"text":"전에 사막의 발톱이 이곳에서 상단을 약탈하는 바람에 길가에 버려진 물건이 꽤 많더라고.","source_cn":"之前流沙之爪再这里抢劫了不少商队，有好多货物丢在路边没人管。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD809E13C868CA94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130722002:1":{"text":"쓸모 있는 물건을 찾을 수도 있으니, 거기나 가서 좀 뒤적여 보려고.","source_cn":"我准备去翻翻，说不定还能找到一些有用的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF53B06AB18FCD93E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130722003:1":{"text":"팔아서 돈이라도 된다면, 위버에게 세일린워터 마을에서 일용품이랑 식량을 사다 달라고 부탁하려고.","source_cn":"要是能卖出去赚点钱，就让韦弗帮忙在咸水镇买些日用品和粮食。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1983C59C02F1973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130722004:1":{"text":"그럼 앞으로 한동안 생활할 걱정은 안 해도 될 테니까.","source_cn":"这样的话，之后一段时间我就不用再为生活发愁了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA82BC2AE5EAE0DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130722005:1":{"text":"그리고 더 나중의 일은 뭐... 그건 나중에 생각하면 되겠지!","source_cn":"至于更远的事，我就没想过了。活一天算一天吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88E771BD7D88461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流浪汉雅各布":{"text":"야코프","source":"流浪汉雅各布","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}